<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 2</h3>The back option is somewhat interesting as there's a few very close EPs to pick between, meaning you have some regen vs throughput options here. This is a VERY low priority upgrade slot, as the difference of EP from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44005/pennant-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_naxxramas_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pennant Cloak</span></a> is so incremental as to be irrelevant.<br/>
<br/>For those particularly unlucky with their Pennant Cloak droprate, you can opt for the Ulduar 25 trash cloak instead. These two cloaks are very similar in EP, but overall the Pennant Cloak still has the edge here. The difference is quite minor though.<br/>
