<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-holy-paladin-healer-phase-2">Main Hand Weapons for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 2</h4>The obvious option, which is strongest for every caster that can wield maces in T8, is <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a>. However, even if you do have priority on getting this, the quest takes quite some time to complete so you need to equip <i>something</i> in the meantime. Contest is a major concern here, as obviously taking someone's otherwise-BiS that you're going to replace is not a good idea.<br/>
<br/>In general, if you have Val'anyr priority, I highly recommend aiming for the Razorscale weapon as it'll be very low contest and be decent enough to tide you over until you complete the legendary (and you'll possibly still get the 10m mace upgrade along the way).<br/>
